{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_16_level_main_16-12_beg",
  "groupId": "main_16",
  "stageId": "main_16-11",
  "title": "深埋地底",
  "storyCode": "16-12",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-12_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "058d35b9202bd0d97a5603334a4975dba3553aa47962c8bc13c0e84ee4df3eda",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前面就是第一次发现“奥卡”的矿洞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按理说，在那不久之后这里就被严格管控起来了......但是现在看来，像是完全废弃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，好消息是矿洞里的活性源石粉尘含量也在停工后迅速下降了，只要不去直接接触失去活性的源石结晶，不会有太大的感染风险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，我没有检测到别的生命信号——看上去不用打架就可以进去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们尚不清楚这里是什么情况。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "纠察队和卫兵随时都有可能回来。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "抓紧时间。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们快去快回。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "科谢尼娅，你确定是这个方向吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我什么也没看到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "抱歉，我只下来过一次......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "让我先找找应急能源开关的位置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哦，在这儿。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呼，看来没错。接下来继续往矿车运行的反方向走就行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "反方向？我以为我们要下到更深处去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "前面连接的是其他地方，并不是矿洞。我也不知道那边具体是做什么的，但应该只走货物不走人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "矿车呢？还能用吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "矿车本身没有问题，但被搁置太久了，应急能源大概只够提供照明，我们还是不去尝试的好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没错。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们走下去就行。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们两个，上矿车。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "矿车里可没有安全带！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们可以自己走下去！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "上矿车，博士。这样节省时间。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但矿车启动不了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别担心，我来解决。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，需要我扶你上去吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......我自己来！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "准备好了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是，Mon3tr小姐，你准备做什——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——呃？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们绝对会被晃飞出去。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "矿车绝对会被你弄散架的。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我保证不会的，你们坐稳就行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们要出发了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "还好，矿洞看上去还正常，没有出现坍塌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不过......下来之前我们应该先烤烤火的。矿洞深处的湿度比外面要高许多，几乎是伊比利亚沿海和乌萨斯内陆的区别。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "当然，矿井内外的温差也很大......你们感觉还好吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我当然没什么问题啦。博士呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "感觉......感觉我的脑子被晃得很均匀。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，你好像玩得很开心！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我控制速度了啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Mon3tr小姐是一位很好的驾驶员，或者说推车工人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哼，看来不是我的问题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "科谢尼娅，我有一个问题。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "矿区第一次发现“奥卡”是什么时候？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "具体时间我并不清楚，在一个月前，第一份“奥卡”样本才被送到研究所。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那也是我知道源石矿井中出现这种......闻所未闻的新物质的时刻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "可是很奇怪......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "像这种矿井中出现的物质......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "研究所是如何把它和“人体实验”联系起来的？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就在这个发现了“奥卡”的矿洞里，感染者出现了匪夷所思的异变。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "感染者的感染程度奇高无比的同时，却保持着正常的生命体征，甚至算得上“健康”......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "症状听起来很熟悉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们在别的地方也遇到了这样的病人？他们也接触过“奥卡”？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "或许还有别的可能。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们还不能确定......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "总之......乌萨斯官方想要复制这样的“奇迹”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我猜，他们是想要不惧病痛、不会反抗的劳动力，甚至是......另一种特殊的军队。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "乌萨斯官方会有这样的反应并不令人意外......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他们还没有意识到这样做的危害。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，科谢尼娅，我们好像接近了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "矿车的轨道就到这里了，接下来我们得步行了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "三人摸黑徒步向前走去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "比光线先进入知觉的依然是声音。水声，滞重的水声。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "三人抬起头，缓慢睁开眼睛。\n他们很快意识到洞内的光亮并不来自外界，它来自眼前地上静止不动的液体，以及视线尽头淋漓的——瀑布。\n液体有着黑曜石般的光泽，在下落过程中折射从高处缝隙中透出的光亮，让洞窟崎岖的内部明亮得如同下过小雨的清晨。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......逆向河。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你看出来了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是的，类似逆向河，“奥卡”本应溢出的部分无法沿倾斜面向外流淌，因此只能往回流，直到像这样“静止”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但它其实保持着某种程度上的流动性，即使没有外力影响。这可能也是他们把它命名为“奥卡”的原因，像河流一样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这里到处都是这种液体。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "根本看不出这里是矿洞，简直就像是一个天然溶洞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "更神奇的是，“奥卡”本身，就像是水一样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这是什么意思？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这怎么可能？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不......只是一个比方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沉淀一段时间之后，“奥卡”呈现出的状态非常稳定，甚至可以被当作通用溶剂使用。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "请等一下！就算是这样我们也不能直接用手去接触——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mon3tr弯腰，用试管从地上收集起一些液体。她没戴手套，也未做任何防护。\n湿漉漉的双手晃动着试管中的液体，她的表情凝重起来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Mon3tr小姐，你不该直接接触——我带了防护设备，你想要样本的话可以告诉我，让我来采集！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（小声）......博士，我知道这是什么了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
