        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这种被称为“奥卡”的流体......实际上就是“源石”。"
