      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这解释起来稍微有些复杂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你还记得莱茵生命研究的“递质”，或者伊比利亚炼金术中常被提及的“心相原质”吗？"
