      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我认为是这样的......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你应该已经了解，源石既是“信息”的载体，也是“能量”的载体。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“递质”与“心相原质”，都是用特定的手段重新刻录了源石能量，用以保留不同信息的产物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而出现在这里的“奥卡”，是以一种更高效的手段抽空了源石中的能量后，残余的空白物质......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以，它甚至真的就是一种“通用溶剂”。或许这也可以解释那些接触过“奥卡”的感染者为何会出现“变异”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "简单来说，“奥卡”作为一种失去了能量的源石，中和了感染者体内的源石活性，同时也为源石的持续生长创造了前所未有的优越条件。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这或许能暂时维持感染者的生命体征，但是无法改变他们注定很快就会死去的结果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而那些被注入了“奥卡”的普通人，由于体内几乎毫无活性源石，产生了强烈的排异反应，所以无一幸存......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "它大规模出现在这里......",
