        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们听到的那些传闻，乌萨斯正在加快开采源石的速度......实际上是在掩饰矿脉枯竭的事实。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "从这里，乌萨斯最北端的矿区开始，枯竭的速度还会不断加快。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我可以大概估算出，四个月之内，乌萨斯境内的源石矿储量将会下降到原有的百分之三十......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这才是女大公封锁矿区的真正原因。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这件事根本不可能一直隐瞒下去。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
