          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没感觉到有什么不同。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你等待着变化，或者回应，就像先前数次发生过的“奇迹”一样。\n然而最终却什么也没有发生。\n来自前文明的产物似乎在拒绝、否认你们之间存在某种联系。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们脚下这些会不会已经失去储存信息的功能了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "或者说，她根本没有想留给我们的信息。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......唔，不是没可能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Mon3tr小姐，博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "快过来，我发现了一些新东西！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在瀑布后面有个空洞，爬上去，站到那里——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我发现矿洞中存在一种特殊频率的声音，它很不自然——不，是绝对不自然！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就仿佛......它在试图通过声波传达某种信息！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们去看看。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "瀑布中间还有这样的地方？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "确实......很壮观。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "来，你们仔细听！在所有液体击打岩石的声音里，总有几段频率特别的声音，仿佛在吸引人注意。它们非常不同，你们一定能听见！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我刚才有试着解读我听到的那几段，这花了一些时间，因为要把时高时低的声音完全记录下来——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就是这个！你们听到了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我只听到了雨声！甚至听不清你说话——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你只是闭上了双眼，任由所有的声音将你包裹。\n直到明确听到了那不断变换频率的声音。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我听见了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——你是说你听见了吗——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "那些陡然闯入知觉的声音，时而由数段频率高的声波组成，时而简短且凌厉，像一张韵调别致的乐谱。\n但你很快就确定，它理应是某种编码，或者是语言。\n你尽力捕捉了自己能忆起的所有语言，将它们分门别类，一一对应之后，你意识到这只是同个词语在不同语言中的变体。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好吧，我抄写下来了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "虽然只是直觉，但如果按照不同移动城市之间使用的通用编码规则来识别这些声音......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我觉得它应该是一个单词，是用很多语言写出来的同一个单词。我可以认出乌萨斯语和高卢语！我觉得这两个词的意思都是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "......\n是的。留在矿井中的流体用敲击岩石的形式向你传递了同一个词语——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "是了，Dr.{@nickname}。\n如果你依然认为自己的选择是正确的。\n如果你依然坚定地相信你描述的未来。\n那就用现实来驳斥我，向我证明......\n你坚持的......"
